flowchart TD
    A[Human describes mission] --> B[Organization Architect interprets]
    B --> C[Capability + constraint analysis]
    C --> D[Organization proposal]
    D --> E{Human review}
    E -->|Revise| B
    E -->|Approve| F[Instantiate Organization]
    F --> G[Collaboration Manager]
    G --> H{Choose work topology}
    H --> I[Single Agent]
    H --> J[Parallel Ensemble]
    H --> K[Collaborative Team]
    H --> L[Multi-Team]
    I --> M[Runtime]
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M
    M --> N[Ledger + projections]
    N --> O[Operate / adapt / propose changes]
    O --> G
